1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:02,106
Why do Christmas trees drop their needles?!

2
00:00:02,286 --> 00:00:04,576
Professor Poppleton here! Let's POP the mystery!

3
00:00:04,756 --> 00:00:06,189
Cut from its roots, a fir

4
00:00:06,189 --> 00:00:07,794
makes a gas called ethylene.

5
00:00:08,074 --> 00:00:09,940
Guess! In tests, when were

6
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,519
cut fir branches bare?

7
00:00:14,069 --> 00:00:15,016
40 days!

8
00:00:15,295 --> 00:00:17,603
Ethylene tells every needle to let go.

9
00:00:17,783 --> 00:00:19,678
Block it, and needles held on

10
00:00:19,678 --> 00:00:20,854
for up to 87 days.

11
00:00:21,234 --> 00:00:23,078
Click on subscribe, so your brain

12
00:00:23,078 --> 00:00:24,308
can be as big as mine!

13
00:00:24,488 --> 00:00:26,118
So needles don't just fall.

14
00:00:26,118 --> 00:00:27,506
They're told to let go!

